  "details": "In the last few days, I’ve noticed how much AI-generated worlds and content have been showing up.\n\nAs an avatar creator myself, I’m finding it harder to come up with new ideas without feeling like AI has already taken over them.\n\nI believe content made using AI should have a clear AI tag, so users know when something is AI-generated.\n\nI also think VRChat should add an AI content filter, allowing users to hide AI-generated content if they choose.\n\nI’m not saying AI should be banned, but users should have transparency and the choice of what content they want to see.",
